UID:10000043-1795541400-1795550400@hi-paris.fr
SUMMARY:Hi! PARIS Meet Up on AI\, Disinformation & Democracy
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Hi! PARIS Meet Up on AI\, Disinformation & Democracy\, bringing together perspectives from research and the media to explore how AI is changing the production and spread of disinformation\, its potential to support fact-checking and investigative journalism\, and the broader challenges for trust and democratic debate. \nDate: November 24\, 2026 | 5:30–8:00 PM\nLocation: Collège des Bernardins\, Paris \nRegistration is free but subject to confirmation: https://evenium.events/meetupaidisinfodemocrac-registration-subject-to-approval
URL:https://hi-paris.fr/event/hi-paris-meet-up-on-ai-disinformation-democracy/
LOCATION:Collège des Bernardins\, 20 Rue de Poissy\, Paris\, 75005\, France
CATEGORIES:Research,Society
END:VEVENT
