UID:10000033-1795737600-1796083199@hi-paris.fr
SUMMARY:Hi!ckathon 2026 | The Hi! PARIS AI & Data Science Challenge
DESCRIPTION:About the Hi!ckathon: \nThe Hi!ckathon is a flagship AI and Data Science challenge organized by Hi! PARIS\, the interdisciplinary center for data science and artificial intelligence. \n\n\n\n\nOpen to students from Institut Polytechnique de Paris\, HEC Paris\, and partner universities\, the competition invites participants to work in teams on a real-world AI challenge with strong business and societal impact. \nThis edition will take place in several stages: \n\nFirst\, in a preparation phase\, intermediate-level courses will be given.\nA Career Fair will be held on November 3 at Télécom Paris. Come and discover internship and job opportunities in great AI & Data Science companies and start-ups!\nIn the final sprint\, you will have the opportunity to share a unique experience during this in-person weekend and to learn a lot thanks to mixed teams with fellow students with a large variety of backgrounds.\n\nInterested in joining the adventure? \nTo learn more about the challenge\, click here to visit our Hi!ckathon webpage. \nRegistration is mandatory and will open soon. In the meantime\, click here to pre-register and be among the first to receive further information. \nSpread the word and stay tuned! \n 
URL:https://hi-paris.fr/event/hickathon-2026-the-hi-paris-ai-data-science-challenge/
LOCATION:Institut Polytechnique de Paris (IP Paris)\, Route de Saclay\, Palaiseau\, 91120\, France
CATEGORIES:Education
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hi-paris.fr/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Banner-events-website-46.jpg
END:VEVENT
