UID:10000037-1796342400-1796428799@hi-paris.fr
SUMMARY:CTRL+SOUND: AI for Sound and Creative Technologies Workshop
DESCRIPTION:CTRL+SOUND brings together students\, researchers\, industry professionals\, and entrepreneurs to explore recent advances in AI for sound. \nThe program features hands-on workshops\, keynote talks\, and a scientific poster session covering neural audio models\, audio AI research\, and creative applications. Jointly supported by Hi! PARIS and SCAI\, the event aims to strengthen connections across the Île-de-France audio AI community and encourage new collaborations between research\, industry\, and the cultural sector. \nJoin us on December 4 at IRCAM and discover the latest research and applications in audio AI. \nRegister now: https://www.ircam.fr/en/events/ctrlsound
URL:https://hi-paris.fr/event/ctrlsound-ai-for-sound-and-creative-technologies-workshop/
LOCATION:Ircam\, 1 Place Igor Stravinsky\, Paris\, 75004
CATEGORIES:Research
END:VEVENT
