SUMMARY:ELLIS UnConference 2026
DESCRIPTION:The ELLIS UnConference 2026 will bring together the European machine learning community for a one-day event in Paris on December 8\, 2026\, at the Palais des Congrès de Paris\, just ahead of the NeurIPS satellite event. \nThe program will be built around 20 community-led sessions covering a broad range of machine learning topics\, alongside a poster session where participants can present papers accepted in 2026 at venues such as ICML\, ICLR\, AISTATS or JMLR. NeurIPS 2026 papers are not eligible for the poster session. \nRegister here: https://ellis-unconference.github.io/
URL:https://hi-paris.fr/event/ellis-unconference-2026/
LOCATION:Palais des Congrès de Paris\, 2 Place de la Porte Maillot\, Paris\, 75017\, France
CATEGORIES:Research
END:VEVENT
